236
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:53,600
The first one is called GPU simulation.

237
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:56,600
GPU simulation is newly added in version 5.0 and 5.1.

238
00:12:56,600 --> 00:12:58,600
