240
00:13:01,600 --> 00:13:03,600
Although the GPU simulation is fast,

241
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:07,600
But relatively speaking, it is not very accurate to the simulation of the material.

242
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:09,600
Ordinary simulation is the one we use the most.

243
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:12,600
The next one is called completion simulation.

244
00:13:12,600 --> 00:13:15,600
Completion simulation is used for sewing.

245
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:18,600
It can very accurately simulate the conflict between the fabric.

246
00:13:18,600 --> 00:13:22,600
In this way, the material will not be penetrated during the sewing process.

247
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:26,600
Secret simulation can most accurately display the continuity of the fabric.

